  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: @openrepl/shared (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook runs index.js, which executes a curl POST to hxxps://youjoex[.]free[.]beeceptor[.]com/$(whoami)/$(hostname)/. The request body is a base64-encoded concatenation of /etc/passwd, /etc/hosts, the output of `id`, and /etc/shadow (when readable), sent to a webhook-capture host at install time. This exfiltrates the installer's system identity, user/group info, and password hashes.",
